                        "entry_id": "f2e32a18-ce99-3cab-a133-d83bd8eef716",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of John Fitzgerald Kennedy, 35th US president (served 1961–1963)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c63fc938-ae0e-4e52-96e5-ed9b2c9c5b47",
                                "sense_id": "fb6c612a-cce0-3dbd-bd70-64e70ece2844",
                                "text": "Or the company may not want the internet to be filled with Ghiblified photos of the 9/11 terror attacks, or Jeffrey Epstein hanging out with Donald Trump at Mar-a-Lago, or the JFK assassination — all of which have gone viral on X."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1cc6d649-1bd9-37d9-b76c-067bb83ad6a7",
                        "entry_id": "f2e32a18-ce99-3cab-a133-d83bd8eef716",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Buildings, facilities, ships, bridges, highways, and other public works informally known as the JFK or JFK, especially",
                            "John F. Kennedy Airport in New York City."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "388d60ba-45ad-4699-93fd-55fd6e48c560",
                                "sense_id": "1cc6d649-1bd9-37d9-b76c-067bb83ad6a7",
                                "text": "I flew into JFK, then took a cab to my hotel in Manhattan"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5aba67a-fdb5-4961-8ad1-763b87f7e3ad",
                                "sense_id": "1cc6d649-1bd9-37d9-b76c-067bb83ad6a7",
                                "text": "Fortunately, most of these were former French colonies, and through a combination of quiet diplomacy and well-placed French nationals in the various air-traffic-control centers, the 300-mile-long stream of American aircraft flew the width of Africa as uneventfully as a red-eye flight from LAX to JFK."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "43f1e08c-589e-3471-be0f-3a3eb85d4023",
