                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4783d9c7-f584-4738-bbe8-53c3ba36664c",
                        "entry_id": "2592be06-cc2b-38a2-bd73-d4d0ded7c444",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "JFKed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0248a17b-8154-31d6-bd79-0dc592b915ca",
                        "entry_id": "2592be06-cc2b-38a2-bd73-d4d0ded7c444",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To put to death; to assassinate, especially for political reasons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1785622b-f8d3-4d33-86e7-2a0a60edb74f",
                                "sense_id": "0248a17b-8154-31d6-bd79-0dc592b915ca",
                                "text": "I am not saying choosing McCain would necesarrily^([sic]) lead to Kerry getting JFKed but Democratic presidential runners need to be aware of the problem."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1ff6af0-0040-4166-b321-ff564f9b4b0c",
                                "sense_id": "0248a17b-8154-31d6-bd79-0dc592b915ca",
                                "text": "The way he is decimating the CIA will more likely get him JFKed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5973d908-dbb5-40fb-baf2-5e2ab44b8e93",
                                "sense_id": "0248a17b-8154-31d6-bd79-0dc592b915ca",
                                "text": "If Obama tried to do the right thing he'd be JFKed. If Obama tried to live up to his promises, if he opposed the neocons and military-industrial complex ..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c4f084d-bf6e-3e0c-a25d-05fbd9dd0f2a",
                        "entry_id": "2592be06-cc2b-38a2-bd73-d4d0ded7c444",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To conduct research about the assassination of John F. Kennedy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "24107ebf-c36e-4a8e-8b97-8dd450852dd7",
                                "sense_id": "3c4f084d-bf6e-3e0c-a25d-05fbd9dd0f2a",
                                "text": "This may seem a little presumptious, but I feel that this group is pretty much JFKed out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a87ed77d-bb2f-4725-a18a-f773937b0c8e",
                                "sense_id": "3c4f084d-bf6e-3e0c-a25d-05fbd9dd0f2a",
                                "text": "I'm going to give 'nobody' the benifit^([sic]) of the doubt , seeing by his own admission that he's been JFKing it for just a couple of months now ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cd3f570-b19f-4355-8a0a-f4ea9b9b4fd1",
                                "sense_id": "3c4f084d-bf6e-3e0c-a25d-05fbd9dd0f2a",
                                "text": "The point is that the JFK world is a very polarized world, and it does not reflect the general population. In a word, JFKing can screw-up a person's head. Look at the ridiculous assertion of Robert Harris from the other day where he said that he took Ruby's shooting of Oswald as a clear sign that Oswald was guilty."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "423481a5-57a5-3706-b4b3-78b454254d40",
                        "entry_id": "2592be06-cc2b-38a2-bd73-d4d0ded7c444",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To hold similar political beliefs or behave in a similar manner to John F. Kennedy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bfd7afe-9b27-46fd-a516-b6da5277381d",
                                "sense_id": "423481a5-57a5-3706-b4b3-78b454254d40",
                                "text": "(from the standard code-word remark \"I'm a JFK liberal\") Examples: \"He's useless...he JFKed a long time ago\","
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31a286e4-70f7-4b06-872c-8ff48a8056e5",
                                "sense_id": "423481a5-57a5-3706-b4b3-78b454254d40",
                                "text": "JFKing is symbiotically related to the \"Even Some Liberals Agree\" gambit, since JFKers quickly establish their roles as the reliable house liberals who provide neocons with all their even-some-liberals-agree examples."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "45d5696c-e1c8-40c3-8603-c2a0cf3e76a8",
                                "sense_id": "423481a5-57a5-3706-b4b3-78b454254d40",
                                "text": "He could've JFKed all the overweight babes he wanted to and that's that."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
