                        ],
                        "form": "JFKs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3ad279f0-0449-43b6-91e0-8e152087bbf0",
                        "entry_id": "7f99c1ec-a8d9-3055-8b14-9219ac3a3e0a",
                        "tags": [
                            "present",
                            "participle"
                        ],
                        "form": "JFKing"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "197d0e53-19ec-44bb-8308-c8e33bf4a998",
                        "entry_id": "7f99c1ec-a8d9-3055-8b14-9219ac3a3e0a",
                        "tags": [
                            "past",
                            "participle"
                        ],
                        "form": "JFKed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c69525bb-4cfd-3b98-8828-51dc76f9a700",
                        "entry_id": "7f99c1ec-a8d9-3055-8b14-9219ac3a3e0a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "杀掉，暗杀 （尤指因政治原因）"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2713b313-9954-4398-854f-c116ef10bfd6",
                                "sense_id": "c69525bb-4cfd-3b98-8828-51dc76f9a700",
                                "text": "I am not saying choosing McCain would necesarrily lead to Kerry getting JFKed but Democratic presidential runners need to be aware of the problem."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dd36f33-040f-4a16-9ccc-c8234e8d92b7",
                                "sense_id": "c69525bb-4cfd-3b98-8828-51dc76f9a700",
                                "text": "The way he is decimating the CIA will more likely get him JFKed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b5eeae3-4449-4579-92c0-6dff41ad9b71",
                                "sense_id": "c69525bb-4cfd-3b98-8828-51dc76f9a700",
                                "text": "If Obama tried to do the right thing he'd be JFKed. If Obama tried to live up to his promises, if he opposed the neocons and military-industrial complex ..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "52f56948-cd82-3905-8d9e-2c0cdf1914f1",
                        "entry_id": "7f99c1ec-a8d9-3055-8b14-9219ac3a3e0a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "调查约翰·肯尼迪刺杀案"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0104c783-5a95-4fb5-bfa6-35b8786191f7",
                                "sense_id": "52f56948-cd82-3905-8d9e-2c0cdf1914f1",
                                "text": "This may seem a little presumptious, but I feel that this group is pretty much JFKed out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f9e8020-70dc-4af7-b0d3-c49ae4d3cbc1",
                                "sense_id": "52f56948-cd82-3905-8d9e-2c0cdf1914f1",
                                "text": "I'm going to give 'nobody' the benifit of the doubt , seeing by his own admission that he's been JFKing it for just a couple of months now ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62f39fc1-0c28-4df3-990c-26d603597996",
                                "sense_id": "52f56948-cd82-3905-8d9e-2c0cdf1914f1",
                                "text": "The point is that the JFK world is a very polarized world, and it does not reflect the general population. In a word, JFKing can screw-up a person's head. Look at the ridiculous assertion of Robert Harris from the other day where he said that he took Ruby's shooting of Oswald as a clear sign that Oswald was guilty."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0146b163-f816-34fd-8a94-5e586f138a67",
                        "entry_id": "7f99c1ec-a8d9-3055-8b14-9219ac3a3e0a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "有与约翰·肯尼迪类似的政治观点"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7802105-99ff-4a36-8a99-a122afd79ef7",
                                "sense_id": "0146b163-f816-34fd-8a94-5e586f138a67",
                                "text": "(from the standard code-word remark \"I'm a JFK liberal\") Examples: \"He's useless...he JFKed a long time ago\","
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c4b5ed6-f195-4cca-95e8-a1b069047249",
                                "sense_id": "0146b163-f816-34fd-8a94-5e586f138a67",
                                "text": "JFKing is symbiotically related to the \"Even Some Liberals Agree\" gambit, since JFKers quickly establish their roles as the reliable house liberals who provide neocons with all their even-some-liberals-agree examples."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97b4dfb4-610f-4bbc-b4c5-733336e6fba7",
                                "sense_id": "0146b163-f816-34fd-8a94-5e586f138a67",
                                "text": "He could've JFKed all the overweight babes he wanted to and that's that."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ]
    }
